## Engineering knowledge base (kb)

Use the {{project_name}} KB at `{{kb_path}}` and the workflow in `{{agents_skill_path}}`.
Any core below is valid only while its receipt matches the selected snapshot. If that
proof fails, use full current context and repair the integration before reusing the core.
{{core_lines}}
At task start:

    {{kb_path}}/kbw context --intent diagnose --task "<task>" --skill-protocol {{skill_protocol}}{{snapshot_arg}}{{core_arg}}

Path-free diagnosis is provisional. Before the first edit, request `--intent implement`
with the actual `--path` values (or `--changed --base <target>` for review). Apply all
mandatory knowledge; resolve missing scope and conflicts. Before finishing, run
`{{kb_path}}/kbw impact --base <target> --working-tree{{snapshot_arg}}` and applicable `verify`
probes. Capture learned decisions, gaps, quirks or scenarios with evidence as drafts.
Acceptance requires review and merge into the approved ref.

`--format terse` keeps the same typed obligations. Use `show --sections` for bodies.
Use `--since-receipt <id>` only while that receipt's content is still in this session.
After compaction, hand-off or a new session request full context. Only use a core receipt
after reading its source above; stale or missing installation evidence must be repaired.

Managed by `{{kb_path}}/kbw integrate`; edit the KB and regenerate instead of this block.
